# ForgeBench Policy Language (FPL) v1 example — docs-only calibration policy
version 1.0.0
name docs-policy

category docs paths README.md docs/** **/*.md severity advisory
advisory_only README.md docs/** **/*.md

suppress ui_copy_changed paths README.md docs/** **/*.md reason "Docs-only copy changes are not merge-risk relevant."
ceiling docs_only_changes posture LOW_CONCERN reason "Docs-only changes should not escalate above LOW_CONCERN unless a blocker is present."